# Jess Less tests

## Structure

- Custom per-feature tests: `packages/jess/test/less/*.test.ts`
- `@less/test-data` runner: `packages/jess/test/less/all-less.test.ts`
- Harness docs: `packages/jess/test/less/README.md`

## Cross-package caveat

If you changed `@jesscss/core`, build it first so these tests use updated `lib/` output:

- `pnpm --filter @jesscss/core build`

